<BaseLayout title="About">
  <h1>About Atlas & Away</h1>
  <p>
    Morocco just had its biggest decade in global visibility: the Atlas Lions' 2022 World Cup
    semifinal run, and now co-hosting the 2030 World Cup with Spain and Portugal. Search interest
    in Morocco travel spikes every time the team plays — and most travel content online hasn't
    caught up.
  </p>
  <p>
    Atlas & Away exists to be the fastest, most useful source for planning a trip around that wave:
    real budgets, real visa rules, real host-city tradeoffs — published as the news breaks, not
    six months later.
  </p>
  <p>This site is run by one person. Replies to the newsletter go to a real inbox.</p>
</BaseLayout>
